Day 61 - Network ACL Investigation
Objective
Understand how Network ACLs affect EC2 connectivity.

Investigation
Verified Security Group rules
Reviewed Network ACL rules
Tested SSH connectivity
Findings
SSH was allowed in the Security Group but denied by the Network ACL.

Root Cause
A DENY rule blocked port 22 traffic.

Resolution
Removed the deny rule and verified SSH connectivity.

Key Takeaway
Traffic must be allowed by both Security Groups and Network ACLs.
